  "what_is_missing_if_anything": "The actual text of the 'strongest_objection' or 'second_objection' for the 2 samples that were counted as positive, or the published pattern mapping that defines exactly how to map objection text to the criterion. Without these, the '2/10' count cannot be verified against the criterion's specific requirement."
